    narr:narration """On 2026-08-07, DaveQuantum announced a core infrastructure decision: [switching the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786095060988_1), justified by [10x query performance and lower licensing cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786095060988_2). The decision was then editorially ratified by XenaExpertgh across three restatements: the [migration itself](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786095060988_3), the [performance gain figure](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786095060988_4), and a [Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786095060988_5). The arc moves from a single voiced decision through rational-persuasion claims into a matter-of-fact scheduling note, all within one day. The register is consistently technical, with parallelism as the dominant style signal across both speakers. No dissent, challenge, or alternative infrastructure option is voiced in this graph — the children form a tight decision-and-ratification sequence rather than a debate.""" ;
